## WHAT NOT TO WASTE TIME ACQUIRING

| Category | Why NOT | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Unauthorized famous IP ports** | DMCA risk, legal liability | Eaglercraft (Minecraft), any unofficial Subway Surfers clones |
| **Very low-quality filler games** | Damages brand perception | Random GameDistribution filler below quality 70 |
| **Games requiring desktop clients** | Not browser-playable | RuneScape, Roblox, any Java-dependent game |
| **Subscription-gated games** | Cannot embed/redistribute | GeoGuessr, Wordle/NYT Games |
| **Games with heavy mobile-only UX** | Bad browser experience | Games designed for touch-only with no keyboard fallback |
| **CrazyGames Originals** | CrazyGames exclusive IP | Ragdoll Archers, Block Blaster, Tower Swap |
| **PokeRogue** | Pokémon IP infringement risk | Fan game — Nintendo/TPC could C&D |

